@prefix : <http://example.org/rooms#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/rooms> a owl:Ontology .

:Room a owl:Class .
:isConnectedTo a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:SymmetricProperty , owl:TransitiveProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Room ; rdfs:range :Room .
